# Workspaces built while working through the exercises. Everything under here is
# generated: snapshots, ledgers, caches, run manifests and the odd `.env`.
#
# The repository's own .gitignore already covers `.dossier/`, `runs/` and `.env`
# wherever they appear. This covers the workspaces themselves, so a half-finished
# exercise never shows up in `git status`.
work/

# Editable installs of the converter packages built in exercises 03 and 04.
*.egg-info/
